# Feature Module Conventions

Each feature under `lib/features/<name>/` must have three layers.

## data/

- `api/` — Retrofit interfaces (`tmdb_api.dart`) + provider
- `models/` — JSON serialization, `fromJson`/`toJson`
- `datasources/` — `*_remote_data_source.dart`, `*_local_data_source.dart`
- `repositories/` — `*_repository_impl.dart` implements domain contract

## domain/

- `repositories/` — abstract classes only
- `usecases/` — one public `call()` method per use case

## presentation/

- `cubit/` — `{name}_cubit.dart` + `{name}_state.dart` (Equatable)
- `screens/` — `{name}_screen.dart`
- `widgets/` — feature-specific reusable widgets

## Example

```dart
// ✅ Cubit calls use case
class PopularMoviesCubit extends Cubit<PopularMoviesState> {
  Future<void> load() async {
    emit(PopularMoviesLoading());
    final result = await _getPopularMovies();
    // emit Success or Failure
  }
}

// ❌ Cubit calls Retrofit/Dio directly
final response = await tmdbApi.getPopularMovies(...);
```

